***About the Framework***
*** Hybrid Automation Framework for UI & API Testing***


-->Developed using Java, Selenium, TestNG, Rest Assured, and Maven.
-->Follows the Page Object Model (POM) design pattern for UI automation.
-->Maven is used for dependency management through pom.xml.
-->UI test data is maintained in Excel files.
-->Application configurations are stored in Properties files.
-->Reusable utility classes are provided to reduce code duplication.
-->API automation is implemented using Rest Assured with POJO (Serialization & Deserialization).
-->Organized package structure for easy maintenance and scalability.
-->Includes a Java Programs package with commonly asked interview coding questions.
-->Includes a TestNG Interview package covering important TestNG concepts.
-->Includes an API Interview package with Rest Assured and POJO examples.
-->Dedicated UI Practice package to build and practice your own automation scripts.
-->Dedicated API Practice package for hands-on API automation practice.
-->Beginner-friendly framework suitable for learning as well as real-time project implementation.
-->Easy to extend by adding new pages, test cases, utilities, and APIs.